านั้น</span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=10&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=443325\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"//pix6.agoda.net/hotelImages/443/443325/443325_130226163113852.jpg?s=480x360\" srcset=\"//pix6.agoda.net/hotelImages/443/443325/443325_130226163113852.jpg?s=480x360 1x, //pix6.agoda.net/hotelImages/443/443325/443325_130226163113852.jpg?s=960x720 2x\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ที่พักริมหาดห้วยยาง , ประจวบคีรีขันธ์ ( Huay Yang )</strong> แห่งนี้ได้รับคะแนนรีวิว 8.0/10 จาก Booking.com และ 7.6/10 คะแนนจาก Agoda.com</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">เลือกเข้าพักได้ 1 , 2 , 3  ท่าน</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">ราคา เริ่มต้นห้องละ 900 บาท</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">จองโรงแรม ราคาพิเศษ</span></h6>\n<h6><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=443325\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1893 aligncenter\" src=\"http://topofhotel.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/agodacom.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\" /></span></a></h6>\n<h6><a href=\"https://www.booking.com/searchresults.en-us.html?aid=1670294&amp;sid=69d58f7f7e99dcb50e0e0770faf0947e&amp;sb=1&amp;src=searchresults&amp;src_elem=sb&amp;error_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.booking.com%2Fsearchresults.en-us.html%3Faid%3D1670294%3Bsid%3D69d58f7f7e99dcb50e0e0770faf0947e%3Btmpl%3Dsearchresults%3Bac_click_type%3Db%3Bac_position%3D0%3Bcity%3D-3256320%3Bclass_interval%3D1%3Bdest_id%3D-3235701%3Bdest_type%3Dcity%3Bfrom_sf%3D1%3Bgroup_adults%3D2%3Bgroup_children%3D0%3Bhighlighted_hotels%3D912348%3Blabel_click%3Dundef%3Bno_rooms%3D1%3Boffset%3D0%3B